From fb28c79bf5ff00773391f5ad69c1849d565dd38c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tilawa Deploy <deploy@tilawa.app>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 01:33:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve 500 errors on live_session, groups, messages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- messages.php: rewrite conversations query using subquery to avoid
  PostgreSQL error (column alias 'other_id' not allowed in correlated
  subqueries in same SELECT level)
- api/messages.php: is_read=1/0 → is_read=TRUE/FALSE
- groups.php: remove MySQL backtick quoting around 'groups' table name
- Remove 8 wrongly-placed root-level duplicate files (auth.php,
  functions.php, payment.php, rate_teacher.php, submit_correction.php,
  manage_group.php, users.php, subscriptions.php) — correct versions
  already exist in api/ and admin/ and includes/
---
